{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Your soul\u2019s been nicked by El Diablo, time to gun it back!</strong></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Free Demo Available Now!</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Demo is now live! Play today and help me reach more gamers!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2b50\ufe0f 8 Steam Curators Recommend Day of Pixel!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >So, Here\u2019s the Deal</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Ride a hand-drawn 1800s frontier: dusty Mexican deserts, sun-baked Texas plains, adobe towns in New Mexico, and portals into the underworld!\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2003150/extras/7768ea3c7b103f2bc809e78b5228892f.avif?t=1758296866\" width=800 height=601 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Play How You Like</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2022 <strong>Bounty Hunting:</strong> Find Bounties from posted boards earn pesos.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2022 <strong>Roaming Gangs:</strong> Factions with personalities that taunt and fight each other as well.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2022 <strong>Farming &amp; Cooking:</strong> Crops, tacos, empanadas, food stands, saloons, brewing.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2022 <strong>Ownership &amp; Trade:</strong> Cantinas, ranches, shops, regional prices.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2022 <strong>Underworld Portals:</strong> D\u00eda de los Muertos lives under the world!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2022 <strong>Companion:</strong> <strong>Salem</strong>: (My real life cat) follows and fights wears a green sombrer! More companions coming.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2022 <strong>Minigames:</strong> Poker with many others working in the background.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Your Call, Partner</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >No microtransactions. No clone-towns. Live your cowboy 